      "code": "Q0001",
      "subject": "数学",
      "qtype": "单选",
      "grade": "高中",
      "difficulty": 4,
      "tags": [
        "集合与常用逻辑用语"
      ],
      "source": "2024新高考I卷",
      "body": "已知集合 $A=\\{x \\mid -5 < x^3 < 5\\}$，$B=\\{-3, -1, 0, 2, 3\\}$，则 $A \\cap B =$（　）",
      "options": [
        "$\\{-1, 0\\}$",
        "$\\{2, 3\\}$",
        "$\\{-3, -1, 0\\}$",
        "$\\{-1, 0, 2\\}$"
      ],
      "answer": "A",
      "analysis": "由 $-5 < x^3 < 5$ 得 $-\\sqrt[3]{5} < x < \\sqrt[3]{5}$，即 $A \\approx (-1.71, 1.71)$，所以 $A \\cap B = \\{-1, 0\\}$。",
      "useCount": 0,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-17 14:16:26",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-17 14:16:26"
    },
    {
      "id": 2392,
      "code": "Q2392",
      "subject": "数学",
      "qtype": "单选",
      "grade": "高中",
      "difficulty": 4,
      "tags": [
        "复数"
      ],
      "source": "2024新高考I卷",
      "body": "若 $\\dfrac{z}{z-1}=1+i$，则 $z=$（　）",
      "options": [
        "$-1-i$",
        "$-1+i$",
        "$1-i$",
        "$1+i$"
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "analysis": "由 $\\dfrac{z}{z-1}=1+i$，得 $z=(z-1)(1+i)=z(1+i)-(1+i)$，整理得 $z \\cdot i = -(1+i)$，所以 $z = \\dfrac{-(1+i)}{i} = -1+i$。",
      "useCount": 0,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-17 14:16:26",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-17 14:16:26"
    },
    {
      "id": 2393,
      "code": "Q2393",
      "subject": "数学",
      "qtype": "单选",
      "grade": "高中",
